      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* How much the policy has changed?\n\n* For a given (xt-1, xt) or (at, st), how likely\nis the new policy compared to the old one? \n\n* ratio > 1 -> p(xt-1 | xt) increased\n* ratio < 1 -> p(xt-1 | xt) decreased",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* How much the policy has changed?\n\n* For a given (xt-1, xt) or (at, st), how likely\nis the new policy compared to the old one? \n\n* ratio > 1 -> p(xt-1 | xt) increased\n* ratio < 1 -> p(xt-1 | xt) decreased",
      "autoResize": true,
