      "updated": 1753123690935,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "a = (xa, ya), my position\nb = (xb, yb), other position\na' = (xa', xb'), my new position\nv = (vx, vy), direction\n\na' = a + k*v = (xa + kvx, ya + kvy)\n\ncondition: |a'-b|=2R\n\n(xa + kvx - xb)**2 + (ya + kvy - yb)**2 = 2R\n\nxa-xb = xd\nya-yb = yd\n\n(kvx + xd)**2 + (\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "a = (xa, ya), my position\nb = (xb, yb), other position\na' = (xa', xb'), my new position\nv = (vx, vy), direction\n\na' = a + k*v = (xa + kvx, ya + kvy)\n\ncondition: |a'-b|=2R\n\n(xa + kvx - xb)**2 + (ya + kvy - yb)**2 = 2R\n\nxa-xb = xd\nya-yb = yd\n\n(kvx + xd)**2 + (\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
